docs {
  # Official Signatures API

  Endpoints untuk manajemen tanda tangan resmi pejabat yang digunakan pada PDF proposal final.

  **Base URL:** `/api/admin/signatures`

  ---

  ## Endpoints

  | Method | Endpoint | Description | Auth | Role |
  |--------|----------|-------------|------|------|
  | GET | `/` | List semua tanda tangan | ✅ | view_signature |
  | POST | `/` | Upload tanda tangan baru | ✅ | create_signature |
  | PATCH | `/:id` | Update data/file tanda tangan | ✅ | edit_signature |
  | PATCH | `/:id/activate` | Aktifkan tanda tangan | ✅ | edit_signature |
  | PATCH | `/:id/deactivate` | Nonaktifkan tanda tangan | ✅ | edit_signature |
  | DELETE | `/:id` | Hapus (soft delete) tanda tangan | ✅ | delete_signature |
  | POST | `/:id/restore` | Pulihkan tanda tangan yang dihapus | ✅ | delete_signature |
  | GET | `/:id/file` | Download/view file PNG tanda tangan | ✅ | view_signature |

  ---

  ## Catatan

  - File tanda tangan harus berformat PNG (image/png), maksimal 5MB
  - Gunakan multipart/form-data untuk upload
}

auth {
  mode: inherit
}
